fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=54c86091bc54990d048e4b7a261afac4, https://si.imgix.net/071cdb08/uploads/origins/710b554d-86cc-4588-8412-8fa70af5d350?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eef5f72e8fee9d6f6cfc0d936f3da6db 2x, https://si.imgix.net/071cdb08/uploads/origins/710b554d-86cc-4588-8412-8fa70af5d350?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3680ca812b6723cc9962dc08791082d8 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, I would like to request an illustration of a watermelon splitting game at the beach by my guess, Hachi.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/HatisanGame_028\n\nI intend to give the illustration to Hachisan as a gift. If possible, I would like to have him use it as a thumbnail for delivery or something.\n\nPoint:.\nThe ears are pierced with 8 and bee pattern earrings.\nHer coat color is two colors.\n\nRequests:\nShow pants and tank top (navel showing)\nPonytail", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@polyethyle/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1482297, "client_id": 2110401, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09a4490c1ed83ec2126bb0a71967ad1c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09a4490c1ed83ec2126bb0a71967ad1c, https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e279a51dbc24dc433fc823132b719a6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9be74729627d405360d9d42a12c91ee7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f78748a6e9ed2cc005c66b8192fa41cc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f78748a6e9ed2cc005c66b8192fa41cc, https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a7344348d03c079dd9dc15a4ebe56eb8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf504147/uploads/origins/7b2bb141-e4cb-4647-9000-8d0d162bdb93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f95502cd22ea8a9022b0e9e073054f59 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Tsubasa Doji and I am an individual Vtuber.\nI saw your illustration on X and I liked it so much that I contacted you to make a request!\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my character who is active as a Vtuber.\n(Please refer to the URL of the document).\nI would like to use the illustration as a thumbnail for a video streaming service and for posting on social networking sites.\n\nThe image of the character is a cheerful, bright, and active girl who loves games and gets carried away when she wins a game!\nThere are no specific composition requirements, but we would be happy if the image conveys a sense of full of energy!\n(If possible, I would be very happy if there is a difference in facial expression.)\n\n(If possible, we would be very happy to have facial expression differences.) Both png and psd formats are acceptable, but we would also like to use the image as a thumbnail for distribution, so we would appreciate a transparent background for the character in the case of a png image!\nThank you in advance for your consideration!\n\nhttps://x.com/dorotsubasa/status/1737861517717250145?s=46&t=un-XZNh6n6gInfs300qZvg", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@polyethyle/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1482297, "client_id": 2312136, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55cf4ae69e61a73d48491c0065224287", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55cf4ae69e61a73d48491c0065224287, https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=324071e0959ab6f00ab7b8d4bbc3b96f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03b2f346bb20c9d9e0ce7b5d8d024111 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f32dc21f79d55e33097fda336cc8246", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f32dc21f79d55e33097fda336cc8246, https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bfae335789b946c816cba71a488f46ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1693efe3/uploads/origins/0cff9d25-3f34-49f7-a67b-17b3a9731058?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=535279fcb8ad15110ab92db409a6676b 3x"}, "body": "Mr. Poli'echiru.\n\nIt is nice to meet you.\nMy name is Yuka Kasumi, and I am a personal Vtuber.\nI've seen your lovely illustrations on X (formerly Twitter) and pixiv, and I'd like to ask you to draw an illustration for me.\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration for me.\n\nUsage: Posting on X (former Twitter), YouTube thumbnails, posting on pixivFANBOX\n\nI would like you to draw me, Yuka Kasumi, as the character.\nPlease refer to the following URL for the character design.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/yuka_kasumi_vv/status/1567512554133684234?t=LMftvPjEiT3HhDwdHyHhZg&s=19\n\nPose and composition will be left up to you.\n\nIf you can draw the background, we would appreciate it if you could send us a PSD or PNG file with the signature and background layered separately.\nIf you do not have a background, we would prefer transparency.\n\nThat is all.\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\nThank you in advance for your consideration.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@polyethyle/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1482297, "client_id": 2333481, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6bc319811ab1f3836cc17ecc1fe4f93", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6bc319811ab1f3836cc17ecc1fe4f93, https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e68fdcfa6582fc566ff8b17fdebc7c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b8ae7e1d5560ceaaa8b62ccd87556e6e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=614c3376007596f0957b6424e0a1b9e2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=614c3376007596f0957b6424e0a1b9e2, https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a44bad54d3db3608c19ac246d836897 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53406b28/uploads/origins/201c8b93-f477-4113-afc4-959a52743cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7b4d4191967cab2574d5f15d2fc965cd 3x"}, "body": "Hello, Dr. Poliechiru. I would like to ask you to draw a fan art of Sau Amanuta, an individual Vtuber.\nSau Amauta is a work registered with the Secondary Creation Authorization Program.\n\n- References\n\nThree-sided drawings, key visuals, etc.: https://twitter.com/crybaby_saurus/status/1735151437322297417\nSecondary creation rules: https://lit.link/crybabysaurus\n\nFixed character points: double teeth, footprints in eyes, triangles under eyes, footprint tattoos on belly and legs, large tail\nIf you need help with hairpin direction, please refer to this: https://twitter.com/fo5for/status/1763929662152192496\n\n- Requests -.\n\nHairstyle: Wolf cut\nCostume: new costume for the second anniversary of the little devil, or you are welcome to create and arrange your own!\nComposition, pose, etc.: I leave it to you!\n\n- Other -\n\nPreferred format: psd with address, background, etc. layered would be great!\nUsage: Post on Twitter as fan art, or use on Twitter or Youtube by the artist.\nIf there is any shortage in the amount, we would appreciate it if you could resend it to us.\n\nThank you very much for your consideration. Thank you very much.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@polyethyle/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1482297, "client_id": 2556613, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47103-0701-4f90-b8c9-bd6e34e30745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a82eba63cb69e446f107ec8991df414c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47103-0701-4f90-b8c9-bd6e34e30745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a82eba63cb69e446f107ec8991df414c, https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47103-0701-4f90-b8c9-bd6e34e30745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39394b168e850b6ce9e6431afeb08738 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47103-0701-4f90-b8c9-bd6e34e30745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b363884b0301979220208f2369216fae 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47103-0701-4f90-b8c9-bd6e34e30745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=459f054b8b4ae83515fb489ce2f6dc0c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47103-0701-4f90-b8c9-bd6e34e30745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=459f054b8b4ae83515fb489ce2f6dc0c, https://si.imgix.net/1b48ed3b/uploads/origins/a9b47